{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your style with beautiful new cosmetics exclusive to the Voyagers of Nera Founder\u2019s Pack. This DLC includes cosmetic variants for the Skimmer, Cargo Skiff, Glider, and Spirit Anchor. It also comes with recipes for new stone statues of each of the four Companion Spirits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sail, Skim &amp; Glide in Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand out as you explore Nera with elegant, carved-wood versions of the Skimmer, Cargo Skiff and Glider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955500/extras/8b4e364a050809560171651ede153db1.avif?t=1758026854\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deluxe Spirit Sanctuary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an even more magnificent sanctuary for the spirits with a complete collection of Companion Spirit statues and a unique cosmetic variant of the Spirit Anchor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955500/extras/84baec269357dc01cf18657f58d79b25.avif?t=1758026854\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft on Any Server</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you own them, you can craft these exclusive designs on any server you play on, and even create them for others to use!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955500/extras/04f891866a224d21c28b84fbd9d84e44.avif?t=1758026854\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thanks for Your Support!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying this Founder\u2019s Pack directly helps our small development team at Treehouse keep making Voyagers better and better. We deeply appreciate it and can\u2019t wait to share the next awesome new experiences with you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955500?t=1758026854","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955500?t=1758026854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955500/c0660ab29bed345cb34fd8134ac2a8ff4a8a359c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758026854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955500/c0660ab29bed345cb34fd8134ac2a8ff4a8a359c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758026854","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your style with beautiful new cosmetics exclusive to the Voyagers of Nera Founder\u2019s Pack. This DLC includes cosmetic variants for the Skimmer, Cargo Skiff, Glider, and Spirit Anchor. It also comes with recipes for new stone statues of each of the four Companion Spirits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sail, Skim &amp; Glide in Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand out as you explore Nera with elegant, carved-wood versions of the Skimmer, Cargo Skiff and Glider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955500/extras/8b4e364a050809560171651ede153db1.avif?t=1758026854\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deluxe Spirit Sanctuary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an even more magnificent sanctuary for the spirits with a complete collection of Companion Spirit statues an